<!-- $title = About - Enslain Metal Merch-->
<!-- $aboutAriaCurrent = aria-current="page"-->
<!-- @include "partials/_header.kit" -->
<main class="main">
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="grid--two-col">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h1>About Enslain Metal Merch</h1>
            <p>Above anything, what we are is fans of heavy music, and this can be seen from our spirit, passion, and dedication to
            doing quality work, with an emphasis on relating to the fans, and delivering speedy and friendly service.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card__img-container"><img src="/assets/img/content/chrissy-and-miikka--resized.jpg" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <h2>Meet the Enslain Crew</h2>
        <div class="subsection grid--two-col">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h3 class="boss-name">Chrissy Hujanen</h3>
            <p>Enslain is owned by Chrissy Hujanen, aka Lady Enslain, who has been working in the music industry as a promotor,
            journalist and photographer, in addition to having sold merchandise on metal tours in North America and Europe since
            1999.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card__img-container"><img src="/assets/img/content/chrissy.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <h2>The Enslain Legion</h2>
        <ul class="subsection grid--flexible">
          <li class="card card--crew">
            <div class="card__img-container"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617121544601-f9cd0e8f73b2?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2500&q=80" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
            <h3>Miikka Hujanen</h3>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Fuga, laborum facilis ipsa labore pariatur corrupti minima possimus modi aliquam iure quia expedita repellat ex excepturi sit ratione dolorum dignissimos quod!</p>
          </li>
          <li class="card card--crew">
            <div class="card__img-container"><img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617121544601-f9cd0e8f73b2?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2500&q=80"
                alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
            <h3>Bear Wiseman</h3>
            <p>Hi, I'm Amy or Bear, you can call me whatever you like. I am a word wizard who spends most of my time writing stories and reviews, digging into concept albums, podcasting and interviewing, and cross-stitching pixel art. You can learn more about me at <a href="https://www.bearwiseman.com/">bearwiseman.com</a></p>
          </li>
          <li class="card card--crew">
            <div class="card__img-container"><img src="/assets/img/content/about-imgs/serena.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
            <h3>Serena</h3>
            <p>Your (not so) friendly neighborhood merchographer.</p>
          <li class="card card--crew">
            <div class="card__img-container"><img src="/assets/img/content/about-imgs/placeholder-salla.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
            <h3>Nadya Häkkinen</h3>
            <p>I'm Enslain's self-appointed CTO, and I designed and built this website. I enjoy fast, blasty death metal and sugar highs. Often simultaneously. My fulfilling full-time job is being a door opener, scritch giver, and living heating pad for <a href="/assets/img/content/catkinens.jpg">The Catkinens</a>.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
<!-- @include "partials/_footer.kit" -->
